{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export the JSON Schema of every event an app tracks as a tracking plan, and check the events against the plan committed before them."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","isActive":true},{"text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracking-plan.json"},{"text":", and for each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tools outside the app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/T